 making private air travel surprisingly affordable for families, couples and small groups when the cost is shared.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/\\u0022\\u003eMore info here\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-764\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/airport-isla-Holbox-300x225.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022private airplane to Holbox arriving at Holbox airport with happy clients\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022225\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\\u0022 data-section-id=\\u002213z8bdx\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022163\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022193\\u0022\\u003ePrivate Transfers to Holbox\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n⏱️ \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022695\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022711\\u0022\\u003eTravel Time:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Approximately \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022726\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022741\\u0022\\u003e2–2.5 hours\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Chiquilá + \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022756\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022784\\u0022\\u003e30-minute ferry crossing\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022195\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022389\\u0022\\u003eA private transfer is the most convenient way to travel from Cancun Airport to Holbox by road. \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022290\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022313\\u0022\\u003eGo Holbox Transfers\\u003c/strong\\u003e offers two private transportation options for couples, families and groups.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch4 data-start=\\u0022391\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022424\\u0022\\u003e🚐 Standard Private Transfer\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022425\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022461\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022425\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022461\\u0022\\u003eFrom $2,800 MXN (1–2 passengers)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cul data-start=\\u0022463\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022644\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022y4u4m0\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022463\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022496\\u0022\\u003ePrivate air-conditioned vehicle\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022h3efex\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022497\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022541\\u0022\\u003eDirect transfer to Chiquilá Ferry Terminal\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00221cs0i8f\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022542\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022568\\u0022\\u003eFlexible departure times\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022cx2w31\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022569\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022609\\u0022\\u003eNo shared shuttle or unnecessary stops\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022jkm002\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022610\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022644\\u0022\\u003eComfortable and reliable service\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022jkm002\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022610\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022644\\u0022\\u003eApproximately \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022726\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022741\\u0022\\u003e2–2.5 hours\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Chiquilá + \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022756\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022784\\u0022\\u003e30-minute ferry crossing\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4 data-start=\\u0022646\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022677\\u0022\\u003e⭐ VIP Premium Door-to-Door\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022678\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022715\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022678\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022715\\u0022\\u003eFrom $11,500 MXN (1–2 passengers)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022717\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022804\\u0022\\u003eEverything included for a seamless journey from Cancun Airport to your hotel in Holbox:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cul data-start=\\u0022806\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221079\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u002240m6n6\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022806\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022830\\u0022\\u003ePrivate luxury vehicle\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00221ygld1y\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022831\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022863\\u0022\\u003eToll road for a faster journey\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022eeqbh9\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022864\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022888\\u0022\\u003eFerry tickets included\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00221lhpmdz\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022889\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022927\\u0022\\u003ePrivate golf cart taxi to your hotel\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022uzxxpw\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022928\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022966\\u0022\\u003eComplimentary drinks and cold towels\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00227ec4z3\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022967\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022982\\u0022\\u003eOnboard Wi-Fi\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u002211mk9jv\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022983\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022998\\u0022\\u003eLeather seats\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00221iqnia\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022999\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221030\\u0022\\u003eProfessional bilingual driver\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00221mhigm1\\u0022 data-start=\\u00221031\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221079\\u0022\\u003eDoor-to-door service with no planning required\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00221mhigm1\\u0022 data-start=\\u00221031\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221079\\u0022\\u003eApproximately \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022726\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022741\\u0022\\u003e2 hours\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Chiquilá + \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022756\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022784\\u0022\\u003e30-minute ferry crossing\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221081\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221275\\u0022\\u003eWhether you choose a Standard or VIP service, you\'ll enjoy the privacy, flexibility and comfort of traveling on your own schedule without waiting for other passengers or making multiple stops.\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-1047\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/B91A65FD-CBDB-4420-953C-D85B8141A27D-300x240.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022240\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-1048\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/529E9A91-924F-41AC-BE7C-473AAF268E52-300x200.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022200\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221081\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221275\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221081\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221275\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_intro\":\"field_6a4e7a9548edd\",\"background_colour\":\"white\",\"_background_colour\":\"field_69fb291d7099f\",\"container_size\":\"medium\",\"_container_size\":\"field_6a104fa067637\",\"panel_settings\":\"\",\"_panel_settings\":\"field_6a4e7a9c48ede\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->','Latest News','','inherit','closed','closed','','323-revision-v1','','','2026-07-24 23:44:17','2026-07-24 22:44:17','',323,'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?p=1051',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1054,2,'2026-07-24 23:53:02','2026-07-24 22:53:02','<h2><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-838\" src=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/holbox-letters-300x225.webp\" alt=\"Holbox Letters on Beach in Holbox\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></h2>\n<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"13z8bdx\" data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"193\">Private Transfer to Holbox</h3>\n<p data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"389\">A private transfer is the most convenient way to travel from Cancun Airport to Holbox by road. <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"313\">Go Holbox Transfers</strong> offers two private transportation options for couples, families and groups.</p>\n\n<h4 data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"424\">🚐 Standard Private Transfer</h4>\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"461\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"461\">From $2,800 MXN (1–2 passengers)</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"644\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"y4u4m0\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"496\">Private air-conditioned vehicle</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"h3efex\" data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"541\">Direct transfer to Chiquilá Ferry Terminal</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1cs0i8f\" data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"568\">Flexible departure times</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"cx2w31\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"609\">No shared shuttle or unnecessary stops</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"jkm002\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"644\">Comfortable and reliable service</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"677\">⭐ VIP Premium Door-to-Door</h4>\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"715\">From $11,500 MXN (1–2 passengers)</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"804\">Everything included for a seamless journey from Cancun Airport to your hotel in Holbox:</p>\n\n<ul data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"1079\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"40m6n6\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"830\">Private luxury vehicle</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1ygld1y\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"863\">Toll road for a faster journey</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"eeqbh9\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"888\">Ferry tickets included</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lhpmdz\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"927\">Private golf cart taxi to your hotel</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"uzxxpw\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"966\">Complimentary drinks and cold towels</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"7ec4z3\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"982\">Onboard Wi-Fi</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"11mk9jv\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"998\">Leather seats</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1iqnia\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1030\">Professional bilingual driver</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1mhigm1\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1079\">Door-to-door service with no planning required</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1275\">Whether you choose our Standard or VIP service, you\'ll enjoy the privacy, flexibility and comfort of traveling on your own schedule without waiting for other passengers or making multiple stops.</p>\n\n<h2>Heading 2</h2>\n&nbsp;\n\nThis is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph.','How to get to Holbox','','inherit','closed','closed','','325-revision-v1','','','2026-07-24 23:53:02','2026-07-24 22:53:02','',325,'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?p=1054',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1057,2,'2026-07-29 18:14:57','2026-07-29 17:14:57','<!-- wp:acf/hero-panel {\"name\":\"acf/hero-panel\",\"data\":{\"hero_slides_0_slide_image\":84,\"_hero_slides_0_slide_image\":\"field_6a465a86ac589\",\"hero_slides_1_slide_image\":735,\"_hero_slides_1_slide_image\":\"field_6a465a86ac589\",\"hero_slides_2_slide_image\":747,\"_hero_slides_2_slide_image\":\"field_6a465a86ac589\",\"hero_slides\":3,\"_hero_slides\":\"field_6a465a79ac588\",\"hero_heading\":\"All Flight Prices\",\"_hero_heading\":\"field_6a465aa9ac58a\",\"hero_intro\":\"\",\"_hero_intro\":\"field_6a465ab2ac58b\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hyperlink-panel {\"name\":\"acf/hyperlink-panel\",\"data\":{\"heading\":\"Select where you are travelling to\",\"_heading\":\"field_6a4b9642320c9\",\"background_colour\":\"light-grey\",\"_background_colour\":\"field_69fb291d7099f\",\"container_size\":\"medium\",\"_container_size\":\"field_6a104fa067637\",\"panel_settings\":\"\",\"_panel_settings\":\"field_6a4b964f320ca\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/table-panel {\"name\":\"acf/table-panel\",\"data\":{\"table_heading\":\"To Holbox\",\"_table_heading\":\"field_6a4b8f4c65b9d\",\"table_intro\":\"All prices are one-way and apply to the rental of the entire aircraft, not per passenger. Round-trip flights are simply double the one-way price. \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u002284\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022116\\u0022\\u003eAirport Departure Fee (TUA):\\u003c/strong\\u003e Some airports require an additional \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022153\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022184\\u0022\\u003edeparture airport fee (TUA)\\u003c/strong\\u003e, typically around \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022203\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022236\\u0022\\u003eMXN $200 (USD $10) per person\\u003c/strong\\u003e. This fee is \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022250\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022266\\u0022\\u003enot included\\u003c/strong\\u003e in the private aircraft rental price and, if applicable, must be paid separately. \\u003cs